                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Reliability and sample size",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Zain, Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "16px",
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "color": "#235F96"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "NPS margin (± pts): ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Zain, Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "13px",
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "color": "#0A1E32"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "how far the true NPS could be from the measured one (95% confidence) = 1.96 × √((P + D − (P − D)²) ÷ respondents) × 100. Each answer scores +1 (promoter), 0 (passive) or −1 (detractor), so NPS = P − D (P, D = promoter and detractor shares). P + D − (P − D)² is the spread of those scores; dividing by respondents and taking √ gives the standard error; × 1.96 × 100 gives ± points. Example: P 0.826, D 0.092, 29,919 respondents → ±0.7. Reliability: High at ±3 or better, Moderate up to ±7, else Low.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Zain, Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "13px",
                      "color": "#3C4D60"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Needed ±5% / Gap / Margin ±: ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Zain, Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "13px",
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "color": "#0A1E32"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "385 responses give a ±5% margin at 95% confidence; Margin ± = 0.98 ÷ √responses, both reduced for small groups using the actual visits (finite-population correction).",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Zain, Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "13px",
                      "color": "#3C4D60"
                    }
                  }
